@baseUrl = http://localhost:8085
@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_OR_SUPER_ADMIN_JWT

### List/filter operators
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/operators?q=phương trang&status=ACTIVE
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Create active operator
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/operators
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nhà xe Phương Trang",
  "address": "TP. Hồ Chí Minh",
  "phone": "+84901234567",
  "email": "contact@futa.vn"
}

### Replace operator
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/operators/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nhà xe Phương Trang",
  "address": "TP. Hồ Chí Minh",
  "phone": "0901234567",
  "email": "contact@futa.vn",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}
